OL,3,GNEWSA'I lied about being in prison -
OL,4,Athere was so much shame'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Pratik Doshi was in prison serving
OL,7,Fa two-year sentence for drug offences
OL,8,Fhe said the shame was so great that
OL,9,Fwhen on the phone to his aunties he
OL,10,Fpretended he was still studying
OL,11,Faccountancy at university.
OL,13,F"There was so much shame... as an
OL,14,FIndian, you are either a doctor, lawyer
OL,15,For an embarrassment," the 30-year-old
OL,16,Fsaid.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
