OL,1,W5j 5Qws js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'I lied about being in prison -
OL,4,Athere was so much shame'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn 2016 Doshi's degree at the
OL,7,FUniversity of Plymouth ended when he
OL,8,Fwas arrested and later convicted of
OL,9,Fconspiracy to supply cannabis and
OL,10,Fpossession with intent to supply
OL,11,Fcannabis.
OL,13,FSince his release he has fought to turn
OL,14,Fhis life around and now works for a
OL,15,Fgovernment-funded enterprise called
OL,16,FBreakthrough Social Enterprise, which
OL,17,Fruns workshops across the country,
OL,18,Fincluding in Suffolk and Norfolk, to
OL,19,Fhelp former convicts improve their
OL,20,Fskills in IT and artificial technology
OL,21,Fto help them find employment.
